{"id":"umsonst","lemma":"umsonst","pos":"adv","rank":1324,"glosses":["free of charge, gratis","in vain, without success","for nothing; for the sake of doing it (without expecting reply)"],"ipa":"/ʊmˈzɔnst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/De-umsonst.ogg/De-umsonst.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist es wirklich umsonst?","en":"Is it really free?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es umsonst bekommen.","en":"I got it for free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392866","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Das erste Mal ist umsonst.","en":"The first time is free.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"just / once"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Wir können hier umsonst bleiben.","en":"We can stay here for free.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Sie können es umsonst haben.","en":"You can have it for nothing.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"have"}]}]}